🔹 Prototype 
A Prototype acts as a blueprint of the software.
Flow: Initial requirements → Prototype → Customer feedback → Design → Coding → Testing.

Prototype Spiral Model
Stages include: Requirement Analysis → Prototype → Development & Testing → Customer Evaluation.

